  "goodToKnow": "Der Denker (die Denkerin) is a thinker. Germany is often called das Land der Dichter und Denker (the land of poets and thinkers), after Goethe, Schiller, Kant, Hegel and Marx; critics added a twist for the Nazi era: Richter und Henker (judges and executioners). Der Vordenker is a pioneering thinker. Rodin's sculpture The Thinker is Der Denker in German. Plural: die Denker."
